    "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:12:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-05T00:14:11Z",
    "body": "That and we'd be sure to define it (in the language) as a protocol that is not dependent specifically on using `AbortSignal`/`AbortController`. I want to make certain that it is allowable that `!(signal instanceof AbortSignal` but it would still work...\r\n\r\nthat is, I want us to say, \"An abort signal is any object that implements [...] function\" ... as opposed to \"An abort signal is always an `AbortSignal` as defined by WHATWG\"... hopefully that make sense.",
